{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"上半屏左侧的大字号白字长句，首先被薄荷绿高亮的“舒服地待在亲近里”吸引，随后注意到“暂时哪里也不去”。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他暂时不再考虑两个人的未来，只想停留在当下的亲近之中。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、自在、安宁、放松。\",\n  \"missed\": \"下方另一层心理活动：他其实想表达自己有多喜欢，也想确认对方是否一样，但因为没想好怎么开口，念头逐渐淡去。水波、歌声和思绪漂远的具体氛围也不一定能抓到。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上方和下方两块大字号文字都比较显眼，会分走一部分主视线。\",\n    \"上方主句较长，包含对未来的态度、亲近感、声音、水波和心理状态等多层意思。\",\n    \"主句下方还有小字连续排布，需要从多条描述中筛选辅助信息。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4bf92eca-4023-4ca7-bf1b-54518ffa45fd", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T020938695972Z", "elapsed_seconds": 38.047, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:10:16.737292+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9db89a7ebbcdcb1d63ef0d49fa3f6b4da2bb87f8e181110d4ea2c6819a3fd283", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\cha